# Support for Gym AI

Do you have a question, or have you found a bug? Write to us and we will reply as soon as we can:

**gymai.app.support@gmail.com**

## Frequently asked questions

**The analysis could not be completed.**
Check that you have an internet connection and tap "Try again" on the analysis. If it still does not work, write to us and tell us which jump and discipline it concerns.

**I can't start an analysis.**
You must first consent to the frames being sent for analysis. You can see and change this in the app under Profile → Consent.

**The analysis doesn't match my jump.**
The analysis is an estimate made by artificial intelligence and can be wrong, especially if the video is dark, blurry or filmed from far away. Check that you have chosen the right element. Try filming closer and in good light.

**How do I delete my data?**
Go to Profile → Delete all my data. This deletes analyses, videos, sessions and drills from the phone.

**How do I withdraw my consent?**
Go to Profile → Consent and turn the switch off.

**What happens to my videos?**
Videos stay on your phone. Only a selection of frames is sent for analysis, and only after you have given consent. Read more in the [privacy policy](https://gymaiappsupport.github.io/gym-ai-info/en/privacy/).
